{"id":"C18e94588f31a4a2e7c33","zh":"混凝土疲劳损伤","en":"concrete fatigue damage","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","definition_zh":"混凝土在循环荷载作用下逐步积累的材料损伤。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"在列车—轨道及基础结构动力分析中，表征混凝土受车辆重复荷载产生的累积劣化，并通过损伤变量更新结构刚度，用于分析疲劳损伤的演化及其与动力响应的相互作用。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C18e94588f31a4a2e7c33","zh":"混凝土疲劳损伤","en":"concrete fatigue damage","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"H3c726a2cd2063b74ddf9","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 徐磊等（2023）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D3a2654c081c9688189a0","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"混凝土疲劳损伤"},{"id":"D2e58ebbd6d2189b8f867","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"concrete fatigue damage"}],"sources":{"P123":{"id":"P123","title":"铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part II:混凝土车致疲劳损伤与空时演化","authors":"徐磊,余志武","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220389","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-ii-train-induced-conc"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S795ea08b5b8111ee84e3","source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"目前,国内外学者在混凝土疲劳损伤本构和铁路系统动力学方面开展了卓有成效的系统性研究,理论方法日臻成熟。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S70d1fe859431d8cd8706","source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"基于车辆-轨道耦合动力学基本原理,引入混凝土疲劳损伤本构和砂浆黏弹性-疲劳本构,基于已建立的列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用模型为基础,在铁路工程系统动力学框架内建立了列车循环作用下无砟轨道混凝土结构疲劳损伤动力演化计算模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P123","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_concept_id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","target_en":"vehicle-track coupling dynamics","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","target_concept_id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","target_zh":"列车-轨道-基础结构","target_en":"Train-track-substructure","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_concept_id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_zh":